Question 9

Find the employee(s) who earn the highest salary in their respective department.
 SELECT e.emp_name, d.dept_name, e.salary
    -> FROM employees e
    -> JOIN departments d
    -> ON e.dept_id = d.dept_id
    -> WHERE e.salary = (
    ->     SELECT MAX(e2.salary)
    ->     FROM employees e2
    ->     WHERE e2.dept_id = e.dept_id
